response:
 First, notice $0.125=2^{-3}$. Then, you can rewrite the expression as: \begin{align*}
\frac{\frac 12 \times 1024}{0.125 \times 2^{12}}
 = \frac{ 1024}{2^4 \times 2^9} = \frac{ 1024}{ 2^{13}} = \frac{2^{10}}{2^{13}}=2^{-3}
\end{align*> Answer: $\boxed{2^{-3}}$

